   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "---\n",
    "# Section 7: Gradient Descent in Action\n",
    "\n",
    "**Update rule:** $\\mathbf{w} \\leftarrow \\mathbf{w} - \\eta \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial \\mathbf{w}}$, $b \\leftarrow b - \\eta \\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial b}$"
   ]
  },
