    "### ROC Curve\n",
    "\n",
    "**ROC (Receiver Operating Characteristic):** TPR vs FPR as the classification threshold varies. AUC = area under curve (1.0 = perfect)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 58,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
